{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_title", "source_sha256": "83d81fa83df6fcaa6f3449a337521f734c1e6fe606c7e6e7995e42100207b47a", "ja": "本番前日", "zh": "演出前一天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a890ab172a82bbfad956523cc6bc9c9caf71f3da0d8ea7b387f5ef0b379d6a35", "ja": "いよいよ明日が本番。緊張した様子を見せる\n百合子とやよいだったが、海美は明日が楽し\nみで仕方ないと語る。積み重ねてきたレッス\nンが自信に繋がったのか、雪歩も普段より堂\n々とインタビューに応じて見せるのだった。", "zh": "终于到了明天正式演出的日子。百合子和弥生显得有些紧张，而海美则说自己期待明天期待得不得了。或许是日积月累的练习转化成了自信，雪步也比平时更加落落大方地接受了采访。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "868899eece8dff764a4ccf955eff6a60a40354bb6fc652147f2bdf9d5cc0981c", "ja": "うう……ど、どうしましょー！\n今日帰って寝て起きたら、もう明日が本番です～っ！", "zh": "呜呜……怎、怎么办呀——！\n今天回去睡一觉起来，明天就正式开演了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "47f2da3d8bd914b7cda3cdaf9293dd22df4d3bce96e1f29eb540a3e8158e98de", "ja": "できることは全部したつもりだけど、\nいざ本番ってなるとやっぱりドキドキするなぁ。", "zh": "我觉得能做的都已经做了，可一到正式演出，还是会紧张得心怦怦跳呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "195406e37830504d5b85f48f9932213b3763be444c11e43018d776c7ab15be66", "ja": "ふん、ふん、ふふ～ん♪　明日よ、早く来ーい！", "zh": "哼哼，呼呼～♪ 明天快点到来吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "019d7330171780e2699b7520484e7a241b0c4da7a4356f92617bb58e92a51cf7", "ja": "う、海美さん、ハート強すぎませんか……？", "zh": "海、海美你的心理承受能力也太强了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "2ef789d455f02437a48868850cd4ea24b4719c6ce1101a2360a5a6d75fbc9c30", "ja": "だって、すっごく楽しみなんだもん！！\n早くお客さんに見せたいし、うおおーって言われたい！", "zh": "因为真的超级期待嘛！！\n好想快点展示给客人看，也想听到他们大喊“呜哦哦——”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8e452beee3088a62923a664fb913b68b997ac73099bc691c21d38d875a49accc", "ja": "わ、私も……緊張するけど、楽しみ……！　かも……。", "zh": "我、我也……虽然很紧张，但也很期待……！可能……吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "540c6f362adbbe15302f8a0db395b26c9887351c80791d439ce46810aa40667b", "ja": "雪歩さん、ほんとですか？\nすごいです……！", "zh": "雪步姐姐，真的吗？好厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9ebd073dcf8cba21fed416ed7f6214094c49b66bec35d3c4bb5013058b96e162", "ja": "うん……。みんなとたくさん練習できたから。\n心臓が破裂しそうだけど、明日は頑張りますぅ！", "zh": "嗯……因为和大家一起练习了很久。\n虽然心脏都快要跳出来了，但明天我会加油的呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1008_jimaku", "source_sha256": "0b74203627cdc8495c233f711cf6645f7b19e7cd8b5972cddee4482526181409", "ja": "アイドルとしての、『あなたの輝き』とは？", "zh": "作为偶像，『你的光芒』是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "357ceebc1ac8a74c7bcc4cf5c558bad06e4a9e198dfa64a2269d5274017287d9", "ja": "輝き、ですか？\nわ、私、ちゃんと輝けてるんでしょうか……？", "zh": "闪耀吗？我、我真的有好好地闪耀着吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "701d3aa0f71ec4735db33e90d6c71d095dfbf7569a9fe02ff845d15f9e4f1f31", "ja": "はい！　はいはい、はーい！\n私はやっぱり体力！　あと、女子力っ！", "zh": "是的！是的是的，来啦！\n我果然还是体力！还有，女子力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "2fd6b364bdc811fb5b4fd62fc287005d67419f90334606aeb829a1f6cf2f108b", "ja": "女子力はまだ、鍛えてる途中だけど……。そのうち、\n体力も女子力も最高にすごいアイドルになってみせる！", "zh": "女子力虽然还在锻炼当中就是了……不过总有一天，\n我会成为体力与女子力都超级厉害的偶像给你们看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "f10b34fcfca23f817a12a59a115ccbd400c603c188272b8062af6b2cb24f3bdd", "ja": "私はなんだろう……うーん？\nスーパーのタイムセールとか、得意だけど……？", "zh": "我嘛……是什么呢……嗯？我挺擅长抢超市的限时特价来着……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "ce487fc8fd8bbf0151f2fcb21ae69816e3d06597f55198d91908a622beee0278", "ja": "やよいさんは、元気なところじゃないでしょうか？\n頑張り屋さんなところも！", "zh": "弥生小姐，应该是你活力十足的地方吧？还有努力的地方也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "9a43417611a8ab7f514a78c9df04c9dfd21d36ceed257c01a824d454a197a601", "ja": "そうかなぁ。えへへ……♪　まだまだ\n頼りないかもですけど、元気ならだれにも負けません！", "zh": "是这样吗。嘿嘿……♪　虽然可能还不太靠得住，\n但说到活力，我可不会输给任何人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "cc9015c7639e477169e27ea1eef1919250316025af7932d8a57132930458cfd0", "ja": "ファンのみんなを、\nわーって盛り上げちゃいますよー！", "zh": "我会把所有粉丝都调动起来，让大家热闹起来哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "07fc4d3c7c5cf115fd21bd86b292223f19c2185af7d718bc669f1f299030be73", "ja": "私は……、地道にコツコツ努力できるところは、\n私の強みと言ってもいいかもしれません。", "zh": "我……能脚踏实地、一步一个脚印地努力，也许可以说是我的优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "245527ecd33c6ed2ec42ed1f436f61d598fd16086faef80f5c2894e543fb8404", "ja": "ゆりりんは想像力でしょ？\nなりたい自分を、イメージできる力！", "zh": "百合莉莉的优势是想象力吧？\n是能够想象出理想中的自己的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "7a8ead882fd592de64a371f6f975760e034e4329324581863150defd7b4a9c19", "ja": "な、なんだか深いことを……！", "zh": "这、这番话真是意味深长……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "429bb9ed24bec72c3dfa47460b7ab1c9f5f672950d1b9f19165c888c0c752352", "ja": "わ、私は……いつもダメダメで、穴に埋まってるのが\nお似合いで、輝いてるなんて言えませんけど……。", "zh": "我、我总是……什么都做不好，埋在洞里才最适合我，也没法说自己在闪闪发光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_13_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e3632941998dd3a8b2d1498cd5b89cb50cc6a5cc9087cbd677eb28e6b4063258", "ja": "変わりたい気持ちを、諦めないことだけは……\nちょっとだけ自慢してもいいかもって、思いますぅ！", "zh": "但唯独想要改变的心情，我从来没有放弃过……\n这一点，我觉得或许稍微可以自豪一下呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
